            {
              "content": "=Analyze the following voice note transcription and generate a structured response in JSON format with:\n1. A descriptive title (max 60 characters)\n2. A concise summary (2-3 sentences)\n3. 3-5 relevant topic tags\n4. Full Transcript\n\nTranscription: {{ $('Transcribe Audio with Whisper').item.json.text }}\n\nPlease respond with valid JSON in this format:\n{\n  \"title\": \"Brief descriptive title\",\n  \"summary\": \"Concise summary of the main points\",\n  \"tags\": [\"tag1\", \"tag2\", \"tag3\", \"tag4\", \"tag5\"],\n  \"transcript\": \"full transcript\"\n}"
            }
