    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚙️ How to Setup\n\n1. Google Drive Trigger: Connect your Google account and select the specific Drive folder used to monitor new audio files\n2. OpenAI Chat Model: Add your OpenAI API key in the credentials\n3. Google Sheets Authentication: Connect your Google account for the Knowledge Base Row creation\n\nThis is a great foundation to create an agent that uses your own audio files as context, allowing you to answer you or your teams question with raw internal knowledge!\n\n## ℹ️ How to Use\n\nAdd a new voice recording to your chosen Drive folder. The workflow will automatically:\n\n* Transcribe the audio\n* Summarize the transcription\n* Add the summary and transcript to your chosen knowledge base spreadsheet\n* Move the audio file to a processed folder to keep your files organized",
        "height": 544,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 5
      },
